# The image only needs the package metadata, the lockfile and the source:
# tests aren't copied into it anymore, so an allowlist keeps everything else
# (tests, .git, local tokens and secrets, .venv, docs) out of the build context.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!src/

**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
